        "original_id": "79fce900-f85f-52d9-90dd-2822b66822e1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Captain Horatio Hornblower, To Kill a Mockingbird\n- People: Gregory Peck, Virginia Mayo, Robert Beatty, Terence Morgan, Gerry Mitchell, Raoul Walsh, Atticus Finch\n- Companies: Warner Bros.\n- Organizations: Royal Navy, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower is a 1951 American naval swashbuckling war film in Technicolor from Warner Bros.\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower was produced by Gerry Mitchell and directed by Raoul Walsh.\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower stars Gregory Peck, Virginia Mayo, Robert Beatty, and Terence Morgan.\n- In the UK, Captain Horatio Hornblower was also titled Captain Horatio Hornblower R.N., with “R.N.” standing for “Royal Navy.”\n- Gregory Peck played Atticus Finch in the 1962 film To Kill a Mockingbird.\n- Gregory Peck won the Academy Award for Best Actor for his performance as Atticus Finch in To Kill a Mockingbird.",
